  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate that the proposed flats would provide an acceptable level of amenity. Given the proximity of commercial plant and air conditioning equipment to habitable windows, it cannot determine if noise impacts can be adequately mitigated. The proposal therefore fails to satisfy the requirements of Paragraph G.2.(1)(c) of Class G, Part 3, Schedule 2 of the GPDO 2015 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;"
